{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "legend",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## System view · planned integration\n\nShared SDRAM is the source of left/right frames and the destination of the disparity map. Arrows show intended transactions, NOT completed board wiring.\n[[Accelerator Blocks.canvas|Open accelerator internals]]",
      "x": -70,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 790,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ethernet",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Ethernet controller\n\nHost/frame ingress (optional). CPU-facing peripheral; how payloads reach SDRAM (CPU copy vs DMA) remains a design choice.",
      "x": -50,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 235,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "cpu",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Nios V processor\n\nDataset/CPU baseline, accelerator configuration, launch and result checking. Separate Hello World proven; THIS combined system is not integrated.",
      "x": 485,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 405,
      "height": 235,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "vga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## VGA controller\n\nOptional display path: read a completed disparity framebuffer from shared SDRAM and drive VGA. Not in benchmark timing.",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 235,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bus",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Platform Designer interconnect\n\nAddress decode + arbitration + protocol adaptation. CPU and accelerator reach the SAME SDRAM address space.",
      "x": 810,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "accelerator",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stereo SAD accelerator IP\n\nPlanned CSR slave + autonomous memory master; reads stereo frames, writes disparity results. Only component datapath RTL is implemented.\n[[Accelerator Blocks.canvas|Open accelerator internals]]",
      "x": 1670,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "sdram-controller",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## External SDRAM controller\n\nConverts shared-memory transactions to DE2-115 SDRAM pins/timing. Not integrated in this checkout.",
      "x": 790,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "sdram",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Physical SDRAM · shared frame store\n\nLeft/right frames, optional best-state workspace, disparity output. CPU and accelerator use the same address map.",
      "x": 790,
      "y": 1140,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
